1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 13=

10
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:23,830
Hanyi.

11
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:26,020
I'm sorry I'm late.

12
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:28,590
Master.

13
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:47,180
Young Master.

14
00:01:48,030 --> 00:01:48,750
Her wounds

15
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:49,980
have already been treated.

16
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,110
But the torture was severe,

17
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:53,790
and her flesh is badly torn.

18
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:55,540
Even after she recovers,

19
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:58,620
she may be left with some scars.

20
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,950
Xiao Jing's poison soldiers
are now a formidable force.

21
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:07,900
They will soon be deployed
in the war against the Snow Kingdom.

22
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:10,030
If they return victorious,

23
00:02:10,510 --> 00:02:11,670
it will be a major military achievement.

24
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:15,230
Even now, just thinking

25
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,230
about those walking corpses
they call poison soldiers

26
00:02:18,670 --> 00:02:19,870
sends a chill down my spine.

27
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:26,670
Young Master.

28
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:31,340
Young Master.

29
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:39,510
You have feelings for Hanyi.

30
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:42,900
I was only

31
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:45,340
worried about her injuries.

32
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:48,830
Young Master, don't deceive yourself.

33
00:03:17,790 --> 00:03:19,630
The look in Gu Hanyi's eyes

34
00:03:20,580 --> 00:03:23,390
is remarkably similar to Shen Ji's.

35
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:30,390
Shen Ji.

36
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,700
Gu Hanyi.

37
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:43,460
How intriguing.

38
00:03:46,830 --> 00:03:51,230
Cui Hong has longstanding grudges
with the Palace Domestic Service

39
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:52,740
and the regional military governors.

40
00:03:55,670 --> 00:03:57,190
We can use this as our opening.

41
00:03:58,670 --> 00:04:01,070
Divide his forces and win over
those he has alienated.

42
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:19,390
My Lords,

43
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:21,790
I asked Censor Zheng

44
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:22,980
to risk everything to invite you here

45
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:24,980
because what I have in my possession

46
00:04:25,510 --> 00:04:28,110
may become the very weapon
that brings Cui Hong down.

47
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:35,660
(Qin Lie, Marquis Zhongjing)

48
00:04:35,670 --> 00:04:36,020
Young lady,

49
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:39,020
where did you get this?

50
00:04:39,260 --> 00:04:42,220
(Lin Wenzheng, Deputy Chief Censor)

51
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,420
(Respectfully presented
to my uncle by marriage)

52
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:52,260
Vice Minister Zhang,
Governor Wang, General Li...

53
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:54,670
Lord Lin.

54
00:04:59,300 --> 00:04:59,910
Those animals!

55
00:04:59,910 --> 00:05:01,020
(Amid the famine in Mobei,
grain is worth its weight in gold.)

56
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,460
(Zhao Tieshan, General Weiyuan)
Selling military grain for profit,

57
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,580
concealing military intelligence...

58
00:05:04,980 --> 00:05:07,630
They're treating the lives
of our frontier soldiers as worthless

59
00:05:08,110 --> 00:05:10,230
and gambling
with the safety of the realm.

60
00:05:11,110 --> 00:05:12,390
General Qin's eldest son,

61
00:05:12,670 --> 00:05:13,780
Lord Lin's second son,

62
00:05:14,430 --> 00:05:15,700
General Zhao's Tieshan Battalion,

63
00:05:17,140 --> 00:05:19,070
and the 37 members of my Shen family,

64
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:20,220
all innocent souls who died unjustly,

65
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,410
countless loyal men persecuted
by Cui Hong's faction,

66
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:24,340
who lost their families and their lives.

67
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:26,390
All the pain we've endured,

68
00:05:26,870 --> 00:05:27,830
all the wrongs we've suffered,

69
00:05:28,070 --> 00:05:29,430
were caused by Cui Hong.

70
00:05:29,870 --> 00:05:30,800
He holds immense power over the court

71
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,970
and acts as though he is above the law.

72
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:34,100
Framing loyal and honorable officials
is routine for him.

73
00:05:34,550 --> 00:05:36,430
Now he even abducts innocent women,

74
00:05:37,660 --> 00:05:38,700
trains them in the art of seduction,

75
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:39,660
and sends them into the inner palace

76
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:41,100
to deceive His Majesty.

77
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:42,990
Unless this monster is brought down,

78
00:05:43,340 --> 00:05:44,340
the realm will never know peace.

79
00:05:45,340 --> 00:05:47,310
Are you truly Shen Ji's daughter?

80
00:05:48,220 --> 00:05:48,780
I am.

81
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:52,990
So it was Cui Hong who murdered
the Shen family back then

82
00:05:53,510 --> 00:05:55,340
and made it look like a bandit attack.

83
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,660
How utterly heartless.

84
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,560
I cannot bring down such a powerful man

85
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,580
on my own.

86
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:02,900
So I dare

87
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:05,070
to ask the three of you
to join forces with me.

88
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:07,020
With this letter as our lead,

89
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:08,660
we can pool our strength

90
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,850
to gather evidence of his crimes

91
00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:11,020
and rally our fellow officials.

92
00:06:12,430 --> 00:06:13,460
Then, before the entire court

93
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:14,660
and in His Majesty's presence,

94
00:06:14,870 --> 00:06:15,990
we will strike with overwhelming force

95
00:06:16,510 --> 00:06:18,100
and bring this
treacherous enemy of the realm

96
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:19,660
crashing down once and for all.

97
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:21,900
For my son,

98
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:24,430
and for all those
innocent souls who died unjustly,

99
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:27,190
I'll risk this old life of mine

100
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:29,510
and take this gamble with you.

101
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:34,020
Cui Hong must pay
for his crimes in blood.

102
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:35,950
My son's name must be cleared.

103
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:38,510
To cleanse this corrupt court,

104
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:42,310
I, Lin, will risk
my life without hesitation.

105
00:06:43,550 --> 00:06:44,510
Count me in.

106
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,260
For the brothers
of the Tieshan Battalion

107
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,020
and for the soldiers at the frontier,

108
00:06:48,460 --> 00:06:49,460
if I fail to bring down Cui Hong,

109
00:06:49,990 --> 00:06:51,950
I, Zhao Tieshan, am no man at all.

110
00:06:52,700 --> 00:06:53,460
My Lords,

111
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:55,750
we still need to discuss our next move.

112
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:11,220
(Cui Residence)

113
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:45,900
What a brilliant move.

114
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:54,780
I, Gu Hanyi, a humble official,

115
00:07:55,020 --> 00:07:58,020
risk my life to accuse
Grand Secretary Cui Hong

116
00:07:58,460 --> 00:07:59,830
of framing loyal officials

117
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,260
and bringing ruin upon the realm,

118
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:03,550
on a total of 23 charges.

119
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:06,260
I beg Your Majesty to investigate.

120
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:08,990
Gu Hanyi.

121
00:08:09,630 --> 00:08:12,220
Today is my imperial birthday.

122
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:16,220
What grievance is so urgent
that you must bring it before me now?

123
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:21,700
And what grave crimes
are you accusing him of?

124
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:23,580
Your Majesty,

125
00:08:24,460 --> 00:08:25,990
it is precisely because
today is your imperial birthday

126
00:08:26,090 --> 00:08:27,200
and the whole realm is celebrating

127
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:29,460
that I must expose
these crimes before you.

128
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:32,020
May justice prevail
under these clear skies

129
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:34,100
and bring these
monstrous crimes to light.

130
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:39,220
Your Majesty, please read the memorial.

131
00:08:41,070 --> 00:08:42,070
Cui Hong's first crime

132
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:43,630
is forming a faction for personal gain,

133
00:08:43,700 --> 00:08:44,660
placing his loyal followers

134
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:45,630
throughout the court and government.

135
00:08:45,770 --> 00:08:47,610
Those who obey him prosper,
while those who oppose him perish.

136
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:48,700
He silences dissent

137
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:50,140
and cuts Your Majesty
off from the truth.

138
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,460
Cui Hong's second crime

139
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:54,970
is bringing suffering upon the people.

140
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:57,870
To build his private residence,
he forcibly demolished their homes,

141
00:08:58,220 --> 00:08:59,870
leaving hundreds displaced,

142
00:09:00,250 --> 00:09:02,390
with countless freezing
or starving to death.

143
00:09:02,830 --> 00:09:03,950
Cui Hong's third crime

144
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:05,430
is suppressing those of true merit.

145
00:09:05,830 --> 00:09:09,390
General Weiyuan Zhao Tieshan
fought fiercely to reclaim three cities,

146
00:09:10,190 --> 00:09:11,460
while Cui Hong's confidant Zhang Mao

147
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:12,990
merely led a supporting force.

148
00:09:13,630 --> 00:09:15,100
Yet Cui Hong twisted the truth,

149
00:09:15,550 --> 00:09:17,070
giving Zhang Mao credit for the victory,

150
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:19,830
while falsely accusing General Zhao
of recklessly seeking glory

151
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,170
and stripping him of military command,

152
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:23,750
leaving the frontier soldiers
deeply disheartened.

153
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:30,740
(It seems
I still underestimated Gu Hanyi.)

154
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,860
(Then let's see whether the Emperor)

155
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:36,150
(believes an insignificant
female medical attendant like you)

156
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:39,150
(or me, the Grand Secretary.)

157
00:09:44,070 --> 00:09:44,580
Your Majesty.

158
00:09:44,700 --> 00:09:45,950
I, Zhao Tieshan,

159
00:09:46,070 --> 00:09:48,500
have a secret letter
signed by Zhang Mao himself

160
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:51,270
and bearing Cui Hong's private seal.

161
00:09:51,830 --> 00:09:54,070
Everything written in it
is evidence of his crimes.

162
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:56,830
Your Majesty, please investigate.

163
00:09:59,100 --> 00:09:59,910
Your Majesty.

164
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:02,620
I have here my second son's
heartfelt plea for justice.

165
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:04,030
Every word bears his anguish.

166
00:10:04,190 --> 00:10:06,220
Every charge is true, Your Majesty.

167
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:08,860
I am Yin Shuang,

168
00:10:09,100 --> 00:10:10,030
Your Majesty.

169
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:12,980
I am willing to stake
my life on this testimony.

170
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,550
Cui Hong imprisoned us

171
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:18,220
and forced us to learn the art of seduction
before sending us into the palace.

172
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:19,700
It was all to spy on Your Majesty.

173
00:10:21,830 --> 00:10:22,790
Anyone who resisted

174
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:24,950
was humiliated, tortured, and killed.

175
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,220
The scars on our bodies

176
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:28,980
are undeniable proof.

177
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:31,550
- I am willing to testify.
- I am willing to testify.

178
00:10:32,380 --> 00:10:33,100
Your Majesty.

179
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:35,790
All the witnesses and evidence are here.

180
00:10:36,550 --> 00:10:38,070
I beg Your Majesty to investigate.

181
00:10:57,430 --> 00:11:00,290
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

182
00:11:01,050 --> 00:11:03,990
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

183
00:11:04,650 --> 00:11:07,470
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

184
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:11,310
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

185
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:15,480
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

186
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:19,110
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

187
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:25,940
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

188
00:11:26,730 --> 00:11:33,820
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

189
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:44,170
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

190
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:46,280
♪I stand here today♪

191
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:50,930
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

192
00:11:50,930 --> 00:11:58,420
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

193
00:11:59,060 --> 00:12:00,350
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

194
00:12:00,350 --> 00:12:02,750
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

195
00:12:03,190 --> 00:12:10,040
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
